Upstream-bound: no
Subject: [PORT_HOST] P6.1 Digimon Lab chart screen hangs from the 16:9 left edge

Patch 0104 gave the Lab's menu, party and slot screens the 16:9 layout but left
the chart (the third screen, "<partner> digivolve") with its left parts at the
4:3 edge: the title plate floated 53 px inside the picture, and the picked
Digimon's description band (widened by DW3_MENU_BAND, so its icon box moved to
the 16:9 edge) was left without its icon and its name and description, which
stayed in the centre. This patch moves them with their plates:

- the title plate (frame 0x44), its open-animation pivot and the title window
  hang from the 16:9 left edge (DW3_MENU_LEFT);
- the picked Digimon's icon on the description band, and the name and the
  description windows, follow the band's left part (DW3_MENU_LEFT).

The recipe grid, the arrows and the "1/4" plate (extended by 0104) are
unchanged. The entry list, the entry panel and the skill panel have no
other left-hung part. Only drawing positions change. Off (gutter 0) every
position is the PS1 one.

